title: $:/plugins/nikorion/palette/language/en-GB/readme
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

nikorion's colour palette, based on TiddlyWiki's default (Vanilla) palette. It is selected by default: the plugin ships `$:/palette` pointing to it.

! What it provides

* `$:/palettes/nikorion`: the palette, a copy of the default one to adjust colour by colour (//Control Panel → Appearance → Palette//, or edit the tiddler).
* `$:/palette`: selects it.

! Use with the Theme plugin

Palette colours are consumed by every theme through `<<colour name>>`. The [[Theme|https://github.com/nikorion/TW-Theme]] plugin uses them without hard-coding any colour.

! Requirements

TiddlyWiki >= 5.3.5.
